{
  "accents": {
    "$type": "color",
    "$description": "The hues a person picks from in Settings. Each is a set of three: `default` (fills, the selected state), `strong` (text and icons on white), `soft` (a wash behind a selected row). The id is what is stored, so it never changes.",
